{
  "rationale": "The plant models robot perception and motion capabilities, separating sensor outcomes from motion commands. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is used in clear/search states, move_forward is used for short progress, and obstacle events trigger conservative, deterministic recovery (turns or full_rotate only as a last resort). Recovery states are one-shot and return to exploration as soon as the path is clear.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for perception and motion to reflect hardware modularity.",
    "Specification automaton binds sensor outcomes to safe, progress-maximizing actions, using random_walk for coverage and deterministic turn recovery for obstacles."
  ],
